  "Aid amount follows IMSS/Ley del Seguro Social rules and specific benefit type.": "援助金额按照IMSS/《社会保险法》规定及具体福利类型执行。",
  "Aid is paid automatically monthly before salary, within a maximum 12-month limit; amount and eligibility depend on date/size/diploma level.": "援助金在工资发放前每月自动支付，最长期限为12个月；金额及资格条件视日期/规模/学历等级而定。",
  "Al Meezan / Ministry of Labour": "Al Meezan / 劳工部",
  "All private and public sector employees including apprentices; Central Holiday Fund applies where leave pay is paid out of the Fund instead of directly by employer.": "所有私营和公共部门雇员（包括学徒）；若假期工资由中央假日基金支付而非雇主直接支付，则适用中央假日基金。",
  "Allow statutory care leave and provide salary/employment confirmation.": "批准法定护理假并提供薪资/受雇确认文件。",
