  "Allowance is claim-based through Employees' Health Insurance; exact amount depends on insured salary/standard remuneration and health insurance rules.": "津贴须通过雇员健康保险申请；具体金额取决于投保薪资/标准报酬及健康保险规定。",
  "Altinn explains employer first covers days for child illness and can claim NAV refunds afterward.": "Altinn说明雇主须先垫付子女患病期间的费用，之后可向NAV申请退款。",
