  "Amount and duration are state-specific; federal DOL directs claimants to the state UI programme.": "金额和期限因州而异；联邦劳工部（DOL）将申请人转介至各州失业保险（UI）计划。",
  "Amount and duration calculated under INPS unemployment benefit rules.": "金额和期限依据INPS失业福利规则计算。",
  "Amount and duration depend on insurance record, wage history, reason for unemployment and wartime rules; some regional official guidance states general wartime duration is 90 calendar days for most citizens.": "金额和期限取决于保险记录、工资历史、失业原因及战时规定；部分地区官方指引规定，战时一般期限对大多数公民为90个自然日。",
  "Amount depends on Central Fund rules and approval; public application page lists assistance forms but not a universal rate.": "金额取决于中央基金规定及审批；公开申请页面列出了援助表格，但无统一费率。",
  "Amount depends on contract type and target group; SEPE guide includes examples such as EUR 110/month for certain long-term unemployed male workers under 45, with other amounts by category.": "金额取决于合同类型和目标群体；SEPE指南包含示例，如特定45岁以下长期失业男性工人每月EUR 110，其他类别金额各异。",
  "Amount depends on insurance period and wage subject to contributions.": "金额取决于保险期限及缴纳供款的工资。",
