  "Amount depends on lost working ability and formula/assessment; VSAA service handles insurance compensation.": "金额取决于丧失劳动能力程度及公式/评估；VSAA服务负责处理保险赔偿。",
  "Amount depends on measure and Employment Service approval; official ministry lists supported employment and job creation/adaptation measures.": "金额取决于措施及就业服务局审批；官方部委列出了支持就业及创造/适应就业的措施。",
  "Amount depends on previous earnings, qualifying period and Labour Office assessment.": "金额取决于前期收入、符合资格期限及劳工局评估。",
  "Amount depends on selected public aid scheme; database is a gateway, not one fixed claim.": "金额取决于所选公共援助计划；数据库为入口，而非单一固定申请。",
  "Amount depends on the specific ADEM scheme; may include financial aid, tax relief, reimbursement of lump-sum allowances or short-time work support.": "金额取决于具体ADEM计划；可能包括财务援助、税收减免、一次性津贴报销或短时工作支持。",
  "Amount is agreed case-by-case with AMS based on labour-market policy requirements.": "金额根据劳动力市场政策要求与AMS逐案协商确定。",
  "Amount is current official GOV.UK figure at research date.": "金额为调研日期时GOV.UK官方现行数据。",
  "Amount not forced because it is worker-specific and BPS-rule based.": "金额不作强制规定，因其因工人而异并依据BPS规则确定。",
  "Amounts and contribution periods should be verified on NII before payroll implementation.": "金额及缴费期限应在实施薪资前向NII核实。",
