  "Amounts are local, not national; check the city/province standard before quoting a number.": "金额为地方标准，非全国统一；引用数字前请核实所在城市/省份标准。",
  "Amounts change by law and category; always verify the latest SEPE guide before advising employer.": "金额随法律和类别变化；在向雇主提供建议前，务必核实最新SEPE指南。",
