  "At the time incapacity is issued/processed; CCSS system controls payment status.": "失能证明签发/处理时申请；CCSS系统控制支付状态。",
  "Attend IMSS process, provide documents and collect/register payment route.": "参与IMSS流程，提供文件并登记/确认付款途径。",
