  "Attend approved AI course.": "参加经批准的人工智能课程。",
  "Attend approved training and provide attendance/supporting evidence.": "参加经批准的培训并提供出勤/支持性证明。",
  "Attend approved training and provide necessary employee details.": "参加经批准的培训并提供必要的雇员信息。",
  "Attend approved training and provide participant information where required.": "参加经批准的培训，并在需要时提供参与者信息。",
  "Attend approved training and sign attendance/receive certificates where needed.": "参加经批准的培训，并在需要时签署出勤记录/领取证书。",
  "Attend approved training where relevant.": "在相关情况下参加经批准的培训。",
  "Attend approved training.": "参加经批准的培训。",
