  "Civil ID, employment registration, salary/social insurance data, employer details and PAM forms.": "民事身份证、就业登记、薪资/社会保险数据、雇主信息及PAM表格。",
  "Civil ID, insurance record, termination/service-end evidence, employment details and PIFSS-requested documents.": "民事身份证、保险记录、终止/服务结束证明、就业信息及PIFSS要求的文件。",
