  "Claim form, OPD/emergency ticket, original bills, leave proof if applicable, employer recommendation, birth/marriage certificate where relevant, discharge summary and SSF card.": "申请表、门诊/急诊收据、原始账单、如适用须提供休假证明、雇主推荐信、相关出生/结婚证明、出院摘要及SSF卡。",
  "Claim form, birth certificate/medical evidence, ID/social security details and bank/payment information.": "申请表、出生证明/医疗证明、身份证/社会保障信息及银行/付款信息。",
