  "Claim form, employment/work accident details, medical evidence and supporting documents.": "申请表、就业/工伤事故详情、医疗证明及支持文件。",
  "Claim form, insured-person evidence, employer/workplace documents, medical/birth evidence.": "申请表、被保险人证明、雇主/工作场所文件、医疗/出生证明。",
  "Claim is asserted through the competent compensation office using the official maternity allowance form; payment can be made to employee or employer if employer continues salary.": "申请须通过主管赔偿办公室使用官方生育津贴表格提出；如雇主继续支付工资，款项可支付给雇员或雇主。",
  "Claim must reach fund within 6 months of insolvency notice; 12 months may be considered if earlier filing was impossible.": "申请须在破产通知发出后6个月内送达基金；如无法提前申请，可考虑12个月期限。",
  "Claim of eligible treatment expenses and maternity-related benefits under SSF scheme rules; amount depends on scheme limits and documents.": "按照SSF计划规则申请符合条件的治疗费用及生育相关福利；金额取决于计划限额及文件。",
  "Claim on annual income tax return with IRS Form 8941; tax-exempt eligible employers use applicable IRS process.": "在年度所得税申报表中使用IRS Form 8941进行申请；免税合格雇主使用适用的IRS流程。",
  "Claim payment, arrange leave with employer and provide proof/evidence.": "申请付款，与雇主安排休假并提供证明/证据。",
  "Claim relates to family leave and annual leave costs accumulated during eligible leave.": "申请涉及符合条件的休假期间累计的家庭假及年假费用。",
  "Claim rights generally follow statutory benefit limitation periods; BLI forms/process should be followed.": "申请权利通常遵循法定福利时效期；须遵循BLI表格/流程。",
