  "Claim timing depends on Central Holiday Fund process.": "申请时间取决于中央假日基金流程。",
  "Claim timing depends on benefit type such as age, invalidity, survivor/dependant or other NSSF qualifying event.": "申请时间取决于福利类型，如年龄、伤残、遗属/受抚养人或其他NSSF符合条件的事件。",
