  "Claim timing follows Udbetaling Danmark/NemRefusion rules; employer should report leave when employee goes on leave.": "申请时间遵循Udbetaling Danmark/NemRefusion规则；雇主应在雇员休假时报告假期。",
  "Claim using the official IIDB claim route/form through DWP/GOV.UK.": "通过DWP/GOV.UK使用官方IIDB申请途径/表格提出申请。",
