  "Correctly withdraw insurance and provide separation documents if required.": "正确注销保险，并在需要时提供离职文件。",
  "Course details proving AI focus, attendance, invoice/receipt, proof of payment, employer levy/grant documents.": "证明人工智能方向的课程详情、出勤记录、发票/收据、付款证明、雇主征税/补贴文件。",
  "Course enrolment, attendance, employee details, payroll evidence and employer declaration.": "课程报名记录、出勤记录、雇员信息、薪资凭证及雇主声明。",
