  "Course rules change; use current MHLW forms for the relevant fiscal year.": "课程规则有所变化；请使用相关财政年度的最新厚生劳动省表格。",
  "Covered Qatari public servants and other covered employees under retirement/pension law; coverage depends on law and authority rules.": "退休/养老金法律下的在保卡塔尔公务员及其他在保雇员；承保范围取决于法律及主管部门规定。",
  "Covered worker or dependants where workplace injury, occupational disease, disability or death qualifies under ECS.": "在ECS下，因工伤、职业病、残疾或死亡符合资格的在保工人或其家属。",
  "Covered worker under SPF sick/other leave branch; SPF describes sick leave and unusual leaves such as marriage, death and patient accompanying leave.": "SPF病假/其他假别分支下的在保工人；SPF涵盖病假及特殊假别，如婚丧假和陪护假。",
  "Covered worker with valid activity/coverage during maternity leave under BPS rules.": "在BPS规定下，产假期间具有有效活动/承保记录的在保工人。",
  "Covered workers with work injury or occupational disease; SPF FAQ notes non-Omani workers are covered under work injury and occupational disease insurance as applicable.": "患有工伤或职业病的在保工人；SPF常见问题指出，非阿曼工人在适用情况下受工伤及职业病保险保障。",
  "Covered workplaces must register with SSB and register insured workers according to Social Security Law/Rules.": "在保工作场所须向SSB登记，并依据《社会保障法》/规定为被保险工人办理登记。",
  "Covers statutory maternity incapacity period; SGK page defines first 8 weeks after birth and 10 weeks for multiple pregnancy context in maternity case definition.": "涵盖法定产假无工作能力期间；SGK页面在产假情形定义中规定分娩后前8周，多胎妊娠为10周。",
  "Covers the additional four weeks of statutory maternity leave pay.": "涵盖额外四周的法定产假薪酬。",
  "Create/manage training opportunity and comply with HRDF training requirements; this is not normal payroll salary.": "创建/管理培训机会并遵守HRDF培训要求；此项不属于正常薪资。",
  "Creates HR training record and potential tax deduction; not an immediate payroll reimbursement.": "建立人力资源培训记录及潜在税务扣除；非即时薪资报销。",
  "Credit equals a percentage of wages paid while qualifying employees are on family and medical leave; IRS states the credit applies to taxable years beginning after 31 Dec 2017 and before 1 Jan 2026 unless extended.": "抵免额等于符合条件雇员在家庭及医疗假期间所支付工资的一定比例；美国国税局声明该抵免适用于2017年12月31日之后、2026年1月1日之前开始的应税年度，除非另行延长。",
  "Credit may offset part of employer health insurance premium cost; generally claimed for no more than two consecutive taxable years.": "抵免额可抵消雇主健康保险保费的部分费用；通常申请期不超过连续两个应税年度。",
  "Credit validity and claim period depend on SFEC allocation and programme rules.": "抵免有效期及申请期限取决于SFEC拨款及计划规则。",
