  "Eligible statutory paternity leave period according to scheme rules.": "根据计划规则确定的合格法定陪产假期限。",
  "Eligible worker away from work because pregnant/recently gave birth or caring for newborn/newly adopted child; must meet EI eligibility rules.": "因怀孕/近期分娩或照顾新生儿/新领养子女而离职的合格工人；须符合EI资格规则。",
