  "Eligible worker's children/family under WWF/provincial board criteria.": "根据WWF/省级委员会标准确定的合格工人子女/家属。",
  "Eligible workers taking maternity, paternity or parental leave under INPS rules.": "根据INPS规则享受生育假、陪产假或亲假的合格工人。",
  "Eligible workers/families under Central Fund rules, especially garment-sector/covered worker assistance areas.": "根据中央基金规则确定的合格工人/家庭，尤其是服装行业/受保工人援助领域。",
  "Eligible working father, including self-employed father, who meets child citizenship and scheme requirements.": "符合子女公民身份及计划要求的合格在职父亲，包括自雇父亲。",
  "Eligible working mother whose child meets Singapore citizenship and service/employment conditions under Government-Paid Leave Schemes.": "其子女符合政府支付假期计划下新加坡公民身份及服务/就业条件的合格在职母亲。",
  "Eligible working parents; employer determination may require employer to provide the payment to employee.": "合格在职父母；雇主核定可能要求雇主向雇员支付款项。",
  "Emergency Employment / Wage Support": "紧急就业/工资支持",
  "Emirates ID, insurance subscription details, employment/termination details, bank or exchange payout details, and any ILOE-requested proof.": "酋长国身份证、保险订阅详情、就业/终止详情、银行或汇款支付详情及任何ILOE要求的证明。",
  "Emirati employee identity, employment contract, salary/payroll information, company registration and any NAFIS-requested documents.": "阿联酋雇员身份证明、劳动合同、薪资/工资信息、公司注册资料及任何NAFIS要求的文件。",
  "Employ disabled employee lawfully, maintain records, submit monthly claim and comply with aid rules.": "依法雇用残疾雇员、保存记录、提交月度申请并遵守援助规则。",
