  "Employers hiring eligible post-secondary students for work-integrated learning placements through approved delivery partners.": "通过批准的交付合作伙伴雇用符合资格的专上学生参与工作融合学习实习的雇主。",
  "Employers hiring staff who need extra support to get started, keep working, upskill or fill a role, subject to Work and Income assessment.": "雇用需要额外支持以开始工作、持续就业、提升技能或填补职位的员工的雇主，须经Work and Income评估。",
  "Employers may participate in formal employment opportunities/placement activities but should not treat it as a payroll subsidy unless a specific call states so.": "雇主可参与正式就业机会或安置活动，但除非特定招募明确指出，否则不应将其视为薪资补贴。",
  "Employers meeting ADEM scheme conditions, such as hiring people with disabilities/reduced work capacity, long-term unemployed workers, redeployed employees or using short-time work.": "满足ADEM计划条件的雇主，例如雇用残障人士或劳动能力降低者、长期失业工人、被重新调配的雇员或采用短时工作制。",
  "Employers participating in Department of Labour Employment Support Grant Schemes; schemes focus on integrating/reintegrating unemployed persons, especially vulnerable groups.": "参与劳动部就业支持拨款计划的雇主；计划侧重于融合或重新融合失业人员，尤其是弱势群体。",
  "Employers participating in Employment Service active labour market measures such as subsidised employment, job assistant subsidy, job adaptation, apprenticeship or other approved measures.": "参与就业服务积极劳动力市场措施的雇主，如补贴就业、就业助理补贴、职务适应、学徒制或其他批准措施。",
  "Employers participating in State Employment Agency active labour market measures, such as subsidised workplaces, disabled client employment, workplace adaptation or regional mobility support.": "参与国家就业局积极劳动力市场措施的雇主，如补贴工作场所、残障客户就业、工作场所适应或区域流动支持。",
  "Employers participating in the programme; eligible workers/jobseekers registered through Portal Empleo.": "参与该项目的雇主；符合资格的工人或求职者通过Portal Empleo登记。",
  "Employers should not treat this as a normal company payroll subsidy unless formally participating in a DOLE-approved project.": "雇主不应将此视为正常公司薪资补贴，除非正式参与DOLE批准的项目。",
  "Employers taking on or retaining eligible apprentices in training toward qualification, subject to current Apprenticeship Boost rules.": "按照现行Apprenticeship Boost规则，雇用或留任正在接受培训以取得资格的符合资格学徒的雇主。",
  "Employers that absorb eligible employment-difficulty persons, graduating-year college graduates or recent unemployed graduates, subject to local employment subsidy rules.": "吸纳符合资格的就业困难人员、应届大学毕业生或近期失业毕业生的雇主，须符合当地就业补贴规定。",
  "Employers using ANAPEC employer space and eligible contracts/programme tracks; TAHFIZ targets newly created companies/associations for fiscal and social charge exemption.": "使用ANAPEC雇主空间及符合资格合同或项目渠道的雇主；TAHFIZ面向新创公司或协会提供税务及社会费用豁免。",
