  "Financial support to employers; official IEFP synthesis shows simple support examples of 12 IAS for open-ended contract and 4 IAS for fixed-term contract, with possible increases for target groups.": "向雇主提供财务支持；IEFP官方综述显示，无固定期限合同支持示例为12 IAS，固定期限合同为4 IAS，目标群体可能有所增加。",
  "First 12 months of apprenticeship contract, subject to current conditions.": "学徒合同前12个月，以现行条件为准。",
