  "For statutory shared parental benefit/leave period.": "适用于法定共同亲子福利/假期期间。",
  "For statutory unemployment benefit period depending on age/conditions.": "根据年龄/条件，适用于法定失业福利期间。",
  "For statutory unemployment benefit period where conditions are met.": "适用于符合条件的法定失业福利期间。",
  "For temporary incapacity period after employer wage compensation period, subject to sickness insurance rules.": "适用于雇主工资补偿期结束后的临时丧失工作能力期间，须符合疾病保险规定。",
