  "Not-for-profit/public-sector employers and private-sector employers with 50 or fewer full-time employees creating quality summer jobs for youth aged 15-30.": "非营利/公共部门雇主及全职员工不超过50人的私营部门雇主，为15至30岁青年创造优质暑期工作岗位。",
  "Notification of intention to apply discount, employee eligibility evidence, monthly payroll/social insurance report.": "申请折扣意向通知、雇员资格证明、月度薪资/社会保险报告。",
