  "Official gov.pt states parental allowance is paid by Social Security to compensate loss of income.": "gov.pt官方说明亲职津贴由社会保障机构支付，以补偿收入损失。",
  "Official guidance notes benefits cannot be paid after 12 months from the day after leaving work even if remaining payable days exist; maximum payable days can be up to 270 based on conditions.": "官方指引说明即使仍有剩余应付天数，福利也不得在离职次日起满12个月后支付；最长应付天数可达270天（视条件而定）。",
  "Official guidance says Kela may pay sickness allowance to the employer if the employer pays wages during sickness absence after the first ten days.": "官方指引说明若雇主在前十天后的病假期间继续支付工资，Kela可将疾病津贴支付给雇主。",
  "Official labour code PDF defines workman, wages and disablement and sets the legal framework.": "官方劳动法典PDF界定工人、工资及残疾的定义，并建立相关法律框架。",
  "Official law confirms employment injury benefit system; SSB monthly form shows contribution categories.": "官方法律确认工伤福利制度；SSB月报表显示缴款类别。",
