  "Official law states Fund pays workers' entitlements decided by Labour Disputes Settlement Committees and recovers from employer.": "官方法律规定，基金向劳动争议解决委员会裁定的工人权益进行支付，并向雇主追偿。",
  "Official law/regulation sources used because benefit details are statutory.": "因福利细节具有法定性质，采用官方法律/法规来源。",
