  "Person employed/self-employed/shareholder-employee at time of covered injury and medically unable to work some/all duties.": "受保伤害发生时受雇/自雇/股东雇员，且经医疗认定无法履行部分或全部职责的人员。",
  "Person injured on duty with inability to work over 3 calendar days; grant/pension may apply after percentage disability from work injury/disease is assessed.": "因公受伤导致无法工作超过3个日历日的人员；在评估工伤/职业病残疾百分比后可申请补助/养老金。",
  "Person planning to start or already getting Flexi-wage self-employment and meeting Work and Income criteria; business advice grant may support training/advice costs.": "计划开始或已获得Flexi-wage自雇支持且符合Work and Income标准的人员；创业咨询补助可支持培训/咨询费用。",
  "Person registered as unemployed with State Employment Service and meeting legal conditions.": "已在国家就业服务机构登记为失业人员且符合法定条件的人员。",
