  "Person with health insurance unable to work due to sickness with a certificate of sick leave.": "持有病假证明、因病无法工作的参保人员。",
  "Person with unemployment insurance contributions for at least 12 months in last 18 months, registered unemployed at Employment Agency, and meeting pension/work restrictions.": "过去18个月内缴纳失业保险至少12个月、已在就业机构登记失业且符合养老金/工作限制条件的人员。",
  "Persons covered by Bahrain unemployment insurance law who meet statutory conditions.": "受巴林失业保险法保障且符合法定条件的人员。",
  "Plan leave and apply directly if unpaid.": "规划假期，如属无薪假则直接申请。",
  "Plan leave and apply for parental benefit.": "规划假期并申请亲职津贴。",
  "Plan qualifying training, keep attendance/cost records and file claim.": "规划符合条件的培训，保存出勤/费用记录并提交申请。",
  "Potential support for employment/training costs; should not be assumed in standard payroll unless approved.": "对就业/培训费用的潜在支持；除非获得批准，否则不应在标准薪资核算中预设此项。",
  "Pre- and postnatal maternity leave subsidy (Subsidio por Incapacidad Laboral maternal)": "产前及产后产假补贴（Subsidio por Incapacidad Laboral maternal）",
  "Pre-screen applicants lawfully, request certification, keep wage records and file tax forms.": "依法对申请人进行初步筛查，索取认证文件，保存工资记录并提交税务表格。",
  "Pre-screening/certification information, State Workforce Agency certification, payroll wage records and IRS forms.": "初步筛查/认证信息、州劳动力机构认证、薪资工资记录及IRS表格。",
  "Pregnancy allowance is 40 working days; parental allowance is generally 160 working days per parent, subject to transfer rules.": "孕期津贴为40个工作日；亲职津贴一般为每位家长160个工作日，须遵守转让规定。",
  "Pregnancy and childbirth benefit / maternity sick leave payment": "妊娠及分娩津贴/产假病假工资",
  "Pregnancy/childbirth e-sick leave, insurance/employment data, wage calculation data, PFU forms.": "妊娠/分娩电子病假、保险/就业数据、工资计算数据及PFU表格。",
  "Pregnancy/childbirth leave, social insurance record, employment/insured income data and application details.": "妊娠/分娩假期、社会保险记录、就业/参保收入数据及申请详情。",
  "Pregnancy/maternity leave evidence, salary data, DSN/salary certificate.": "妊娠/产假证明、薪资数据及DSN/薪资证明。",
  "Pregnancy/maternity notice, medical or expected delivery evidence and employment records.": "妊娠/产假通知、医疗或预产期证明及就业记录。",
  "Pregnancy/medical documents, employment records and any documents required by employer/labour authority.": "妊娠/医疗文件、就业记录及雇主/劳工当局要求的任何文件。",
  "Pregnant employee with employment contract; employer arranges maternity pay through UWV.": "持有劳动合同的怀孕雇员；雇主通过UWV安排产假工资。",
  "Pregnant employee, apprentice or self-employed person covered by Luxembourg social security and meeting maternity leave conditions.": "受卢森堡社会保障保障且符合产假条件的怀孕雇员、学徒或自雇人士。",
  "Pregnant insured worker meeting EsSalud contribution and employment conditions.": "符合EsSalud缴费及就业条件的怀孕参保工人。",
  "Pregnant insured worker registered with IMSS who obtains maternity incapacity certificate and meets IMSS requirements.": "已在IMSS登记、获得产假丧失劳动能力证明且符合IMSS要求的怀孕参保工人。",
  "Pregnant worker from 26 weeks up should complete request form as soon as possible for additional allowance per NSSF notice.": "依据NSSF通知，妊娠26周以上的工人应尽快填写申请表以获得额外津贴。",
  "Pregnant/adopting claimant who does not receive paid maternity/adoption leave from employer, or employed woman using full employer-paid maternity leave for leave benefit.": "未从雇主获得带薪产假/收养假的怀孕/收养申请人，或使用全额雇主带薪产假申请假期福利的在职女性。",
  "Prenatal 6 weeks / 42 days before expected birth; postnatal 12 weeks / 84 days after birth; postnatal parental leave may follow under maternity-protection rules.": "产前6周/预产期前42天；产后12周/分娩后84天；依据产假保护规定，产后可接续亲职假。",
  "Prenatal and postnatal maternity leave period under Luxembourg rules.": "依据卢森堡规定的产前及产后产假期间。",
  "Prenatal/postnatal maternity leave period according to medical certificate and law.": "依据医疗证明及法律规定的产前/产后产假期间。",
  "Prepare and submit form with medical evidence.": "准备并提交附有医疗证明的表格。",
  "Prepare employer forms/list, confirm contributions and submit/coordinate dossier with VSS.": "准备雇主表格/清单，确认缴费情况，并与VSS提交/协调档案。",
  "Prepare/endorse application and provide salary/attendance records.": "准备/批准申请并提供薪资/出勤记录。",
  "Preventive occupational healthcare is mandatory for employers in Finland.": "在芬兰，预防性职业保健对雇主而言是强制性的。",
  "Primary carer taking time off work to care for a new baby or child under 6 and meeting New Zealand work requirements.": "主要照顾者请假照顾新生儿或6岁以下儿童且符合新西兰工作要求的人员。",
  "Prime Minister Employment Programme / National Employment Promotion Programme": "总理就业计划/国家就业促进计划",
  "Private Sector Maternity Leave Wage Compensation": "私营部门产假工资补偿",
  "Private employer; self-employed/private entrepreneur": "私营雇主；自雇/私人企业家",
  "Private employers generally do not claim this as payroll subsidy; local government/programme manages employment.": "私营雇主通常不将此作为薪资补贴申请；地方政府/计划负责管理就业事宜。",
  "Private employers paying salary during maternity/paternity leave; self-employed/private entrepreneurs on maternity/paternity leave may receive compensation.": "在产假/陪产假期间支付薪资的私营雇主；处于产假/陪产假的自雇/私人企业家可能获得补偿。",
  "Private individual claiming qualifying training expenses on income tax return under Estonian Tax and Customs Board rules.": "依据爱沙尼亚税务与海关委员会规定，在所得税申报表中申报符合条件培训费用的私人个人。",
  "Private sector employer that meets conditions and requests reduction in work injury insurance contribution in exchange for paying wage compensation and transportation expenses.": "符合条件并申请降低工伤保险缴费、以支付工资补偿及交通费用作为交换条件的私营部门雇主。",
  "Private sector enterprises employing Bahraini talent through eligible tracks, including Jobs+ / programme channels.": "通过合资格途径（包括Jobs+/计划渠道）聘用巴林人才的私营部门企业。",
  "Private-sector Maternity Leave": "私营部门产假",
