  "Temporary incapacity for occupational disease benefit": "职业病临时丧失劳动能力福利",
  "Temporary unemployment benefit under SSC law; exact amount/duration depends on contribution account and law/bylaws.": "SSC法律下的临时失业福利；具体金额/期限取决于缴款账户及法律/章程。",
  "Temporary unemployment income support while the worker is unemployed and meets conditions.": "工人失业且符合条件期间的临时失业收入支持。",
  "Temporary unemployment support according to NSSF law/rules.": "根据NSSF法律/规则提供的临时失业支持。",
  "Temporary wage public employment package; pay depends on applicable minimum wage/project rules and DOLE guidelines.": "临时工资公共就业套餐；薪酬取决于适用最低工资/项目规则及劳动和就业部指引。",
  "Temporary, subject to approval and statutory maximum periods depending on situation.": "临时性质，须经批准，最长期限视情况而定，受法定上限约束。",
  "Termination documents, wage data, Employment Service reporting, tax/exemption authorizations if relevant.": "终止合同文件、工资数据、就业服务申报、相关税务/豁免授权文件。",
  "Termination evidence, ID, severance fund/compensation fund records and contribution/savings information.": "终止合同证明、身份证件、遣散费基金/补偿基金记录及缴款/储蓄信息。",
  "Termination evidence, identity/NIC, employment history, Workfare registration and bank details.": "终止合同证明、身份/NIC证件、就业历史、Workfare登记及银行详情。",
  "Termination reporting and payroll contribution accuracy affect eligibility.": "终止合同申报及薪资缴款准确性影响申请资格。",
  "Termination/finiquito or equivalent termination evidence, identity details and contribution record.": "终止合同/finiquito或同等终止证明、身份信息及缴款记录。",
  "Termination/loss-of-employment evidence, identity, contribution record, bank details, job-search/training evidence where relevant.": "终止合同/失业证明、身份证件、缴款记录、银行详情及相关求职/培训证明。",
  "Termination/separation details, identity, insurance records and İŞKUR application.": "终止合同/离职详情、身份证件、保险记录及İŞKUR申请。",
  "Termination/unemployment details, contribution records, identity/bank data and INPS requested documents.": "终止合同/失业详情、缴款记录、身份/银行数据及INPS要求文件。",
  "Termination/unemployment evidence, NSSF contribution record, identity documents and bank/payment details.": "终止合同/失业证明、NSSF缴款记录、身份文件及银行/支付详情。",
  "Thailand has a social security benefit model rather than employer reimbursement for statutory maternity leave.": "泰国法定产假采用社会保障福利模式，而非雇主报销模式。",
  "The accidents page says the employer, worker or anyone aware of the accident/occupational disease may report it to the ART.": "事故页面说明，雇主、工人或任何知悉事故/职业病的人员均可向ART报告。",
  "The official guideline states JobsPlus is a monthly employer payment to offset wage costs.": "官方指引说明JobsPlus是每月向雇主支付的补偿工资成本款项。",
  "The report deadline is a key compliance point for employers.": "报告截止日期是雇主的重要合规要点。",
  "This is a government-regulated statutory claim, not a government-paid reimbursement.": "这是政府监管的法定申请，而非政府支付的报销。",
  "This is a social insurance income-replacement claim, not a general employer grant.": "这是社会保险收入替代申请，而非一般雇主补助金。",
  "This is a statutory worker entitlement and employer obligation, not a government grant.": "这是法定工人权利和雇主义务，而非政府补助金。",
  "This is an insurance/social-security style claim, not an employer reimbursement.": "这是保险/社会保障式申请，而非雇主报销。",
  "This is employer-paid leave, so there is no public reimbursement row unless a separate sector/emirate programme applies.": "这是雇主支付的假期，除非有独立的行业/酋长国计划适用，否则不存在公共报销项目。",
  "This is not a benefit programme, but a practical government claim/refund workflow for payroll errors.": "这不是福利计划，而是针对薪资错误的实际政府申请/退款流程。",
  "This is not an employer payroll subsidy; it is relevant to offboarding guidance and employee claims.": "这不是雇主薪资补贴；与离职指引及雇员申请相关。",
  "Through normal PAYE reporting/payment cycle or HMRC advance funding process.": "通过正常的PAYE申报/支付周期或HMRC预付资金流程。",
  "Time-limited compensation; employment itself does not have to be time-limited.": "有时限的补偿；就业本身无需设有时限。",
  "Track absence as work injury; coordinate wage replacement/medical coverage with ART.": "将缺勤记录为工伤；与ART协调工资替代/医疗保障事宜。",
  "Track as work injury absence; NII benefit may affect wage replacement/top-up.": "记录为工伤缺勤；NII福利可能影响工资替代/补贴。",
  "Track as work injury absence; payroll must support wage/compensation calculations.": "记录为工伤缺勤；薪资系统须支持工资/赔偿计算。",
  "Track leave costs, submit application and keep payroll evidence.": "追踪假期费用，提交申请并保存薪资证明。",
  "Track medical absence and consult BPS worker-subsidy status where available.": "追踪医疗缺勤，并在可用时查询BPS工人补贴状态。",
