  "Training assistance and incentives under programme rules; amounts change by wave/budget and should be checked on official Prakerja platform.": "项目规则下的培训援助及激励措施；金额因批次/预算而变化，应在官方Prakerja平台核实。",
  "Training claims must reach the relevant ITF Area Office on or before 30 June after the training year.": "培训申请须于培训年度结束后的6月30日或之前送达相关ITF地区办事处。",
  "Training costs can be claimed by employers upon completion through grant disbursements from HRD levy collection; amount depends on approved grant, allowable cost matrix and levy balance.": "雇主可在完成培训后通过人力资源发展征费拨款报销培训费用；金额取决于已批准补助金、允许费用矩阵及征费余额。",
  "Training duration generally 3 to 6 months, according to HRDF product page.": "根据HRDF产品页面，培训期限一般为3至6个月。",
  "Training funding reduces/structures employer training cost; payroll must handle apprentice pay separately.": "培训资助减少/规范雇主培训成本；薪资系统须单独处理学徒薪酬。",
  "Training invoices/receipts and tax return evidence.": "培训发票/收据及税务申报证明。",
