  "Training plan, curriculum, attendance, cost invoices, wage records and employee/employer eligibility evidence.": "培训计划、课程大纲、出勤记录、费用发票、工资记录及雇员/雇主资格证明。",
  "Training plan, provider/course evidence, employee details, cost documents.": "培训计划、服务提供商/课程证明、雇员详情、费用文件。",
  "Training proposal, enterprise/training provider details, participant list, budget and SDF-required evidence.": "培训方案、企业/培训提供商详情、参与者名单、预算及SDF所需证明材料。",
  "Training refund offsets employer training cost after approval; not automatic without HRDC claim.": "培训退款在获批后抵消雇主培训成本；未提交HRDC申请则不会自动退款。",
  "Training voucher / education support": "培训券/教育支持",
  "Training/hiring support; payroll must track apprentices and monthly support evidence.": "培训/招聘支持；薪资系统须追踪学徒及每月支持证明。",
  "Transition Unemployment Benefit": "过渡性失业救济金",
  "Transition period under the Workfare/official programme rules.": "根据就业援助计划/官方项目规则的过渡期。",
  "Transmit/record sick leave and payroll delegated payment data where applicable.": "在适用情况下，传输/记录病假及工资委托支付数据。",
  "Treat as HRDF trainee support, not standard employment salary unless a separate employment contract exists.": "视为人力资源发展基金学员支持，而非标准就业薪资，除非存在单独的劳动合同。",
  "Treat as statutory protected leave; coordinate payroll so company salary is not double counted against state/social security subsidy.": "视为法定保护假期；协调工资核算，确保公司薪资不与国家/社会保障补贴重复计算。",
