  "UAE nationals and residents working in the federal government or private sector who are subscribed and meet the required conditions; excluded categories include investors/owners, domestic workers, temporary-contract employees, juveniles under 18 and retirees who joined a new job.": "在联邦政府或私营部门工作、已参保并符合规定条件的阿联酋国民及居民；排除类别包括投资者/业主、家政工人、临时合同雇员、18岁以下未成年人及再次就业的退休人员。",
  "UIF adoption benefit": "UIF收养津贴",
  "UIF benefit amount follows UIF benefit schedule/credits and offsets against employer-paid remuneration where applicable.": "UIF福利金额遵循UIF福利计划/积分标准，并在适用情况下抵扣雇主支付的薪酬。",
  "UIF contributor on maternity leave who satisfies UIF maternity benefit conditions, including contribution/employment requirements.": "处于产假期间且满足UIF生育津贴条件（包括缴费/就业要求）的UIF缴纳人。",
