  "UIF contributor who becomes unemployed, has available UIF credits and meets the Unemployment Insurance Fund claim conditions.": "失业、拥有可用UIF积分并满足失业保险基金申请条件的UIF缴纳人。",
  "UIF contributor who is unable to work because of illness and satisfies UIF benefit conditions.": "因病无法工作且满足UIF福利条件的UIF缴纳人。",
