  "UWV / Belastingdienst": "UWV/税务局（Belastingdienst）",
  "UWV maternity pay; in most cases transferred to employer every 4 weeks, then employer continues paying salary. Amount based on UWV WAZO rules.": "UWV生育津贴；大多数情况下每4周转给雇主，然后由雇主继续支付薪资。金额依据UWV WAZO规则计算。",
  "UWV sickness benefit (Ziektewet-uitkering) in special cases": "特殊情况下的UWV疾病津贴（Ziektewet-uitkering）",
  "UWV sickness benefit; amount depends on case. Employer may still need minimum-wage top-up in first year if pay falls below minimum wage.": "UWV疾病津贴；金额视具体情况而定。若薪资低于最低工资标准，雇主在第一年可能仍需补足至最低工资。",
  "Udbetaling Danmark / Business in Denmark (Virk)": "丹麦支付局（Udbetaling Danmark）/丹麦商业门户（Virk）",
  "Unemployed person registered with Employment Service and with at least 12 months unemployment insurance record in last 30 months; partial work applies when employer lawfully declares partial work.": "已在就业服务机构登记、且在过去30个月内拥有至少12个月失业保险记录的失业人员；当雇主依法申报部分工作时，适用部分工作规定。",
  "Unemployed person who is member of an unemployment insurance fund and meets benefit conditions.": "属于失业保险基金成员且满足津贴条件的失业人员。",
