  "Unemployment benefit": "失业津贴",
  "Unemployment benefit amount depends on reason for unemployment and Social Security rules.": "失业津贴金额取决于失业原因及社会保障规定。",
  "Unemployment benefit for 9 months; partial work benefit up to 3 months.": "失业津贴期限为9个月；部分工作津贴最长3个月。",
  "Unemployment benefit paid 9 months: fixed component 23.27% of minimum monthly wage plus variable component: 38.79%, 31.03%, then 23.27% of average insured income by period; cap applies. Partial work benefit can be up to 50% of unemployment benefit.": "失业津贴支付9个月：固定部分为最低月工资的23.27%，加上可变部分：按期间分别为平均参保收入的38.79%、31.03%，再降至23.27%；设有上限。部分工作津贴最高可达失业津贴的50%。",
  "Unemployment compensation application form and supporting termination/employment/insurance documents.": "失业补偿申请表及支持性终止劳动关系/就业/保险文件。",
  "Unemployment compensation is paid under PIFSS unemployment insurance; exact amount and duration follow the law and PIFSS assessment.": "失业补偿依据PIFSS失业保险支付；具体金额和期限遵循相关法律及PIFSS评估结果。",
  "Unemployment insurance benefit": "失业保险津贴",
  "Unemployment insurance benefit / Partial work benefit": "失业保险津贴/部分工作津贴",
  "Unemployment registration and compensation": "失业登记与补偿",
  "Unemployment registration and programme documents required by local employment service centre.": "地方就业服务中心要求的失业登记及项目文件。",
  "Unemployment registration, ID/social security details, bank account, termination/separation details.": "失业登记、身份证/社会保障信息、银行账户、劳动关系终止/离职详情。",
  "Unemployment registration, identity, insurance/contribution records, employment termination data and application.": "失业登记、身份信息、保险/缴费记录、劳动关系终止数据及申请材料。",
  "Unlimited claims up to lifetime maximum of HKD 25,000 reimbursement.": "不限次数申请，终身最高报销港币25,000元。",
  "Until child turns 18 or 24 months depending on chosen option; non-transferable months apply.": "根据所选方案，直至子女满18个月或24个月；不可转让的月数条款适用。",
  "Until recovery or up to 52 weeks.": "直至康复或最长52周。",
  "Until statutory child age/condition depending on benefit type; insertion incentive for return to work.": "根据福利类型，直至达到法定子女年龄/条件；设有重返工作岗位激励机制。",
  "Until working capacity is restored or invalidity established; statutory limits apply in some cases.": "直至恢复劳动能力或被认定为残疾；某些情况下适用法定期限限制。",
  "Up to 100 days in first year / 150 days in three years for leave/training; secondment up to 1 year, subject to rules.": "假期/培训在第一年最多100天/三年内最多150天；借调最长1年，须遵守相关规定。",
  "Up to 120 days per calendar year according to SSS public guidance, subject to medical and contribution conditions.": "根据SSS公开指引，每日历年最多120天，须满足医疗及缴费条件。",
  "Up to 14 weeks for maternity/adoption benefit; up to 4 weeks for maternity leave benefit.": "生育/收养津贴最长14周；产假津贴最长4周。",
  "Up to 15 weeks / 105 days if full contribution condition is met; 8 weeks / 56 days for partial entitlement.": "满足完整缴费条件最长15周/105天；部分资格享有8周/56天。",
  "Up to 26 weeks according to current EI sickness benefit rules.": "根据现行就业保险疾病津贴规定，最长26周。",
  "Up to 3 months per claim, with an overall coverage cap under the unemployment insurance law.": "每次申请最长3个月，依失业保险法规定设有总体保障上限。",
  "Up to 5 further weeks paid leave; UWV benefit applies under WAZO rules.": "额外最多5周带薪假期；依据WAZO规则适用UWV津贴。",
  "Up to 5 years depending on selected support track.": "根据所选支持方案，最长5年。",
  "Up to 6 months cash benefit.": "最长6个月现金津贴。",
  "Up to 6 months.": "最长6个月。",
  "Up to 6 months; up to 9 months for eligible older workers or persons with disability under BLI rules.": "最长6个月；根据BLI规定，符合条件的年长工人或残疾人士最长9个月。",
  "Up to 84 calendar days of maternity rest with subsidy paid in one payment if requirements are met; exact amount follows IMSS/Ley del Seguro Social rules.": "最长84个历日产假休息，若满足要求则一次性支付补贴；具体金额遵循IMSS/《社会保险法》规定。",
  "Up to 84 calendar days; prenatal days may be transferred to postnatal under IMSS process.": "最长84个历日；产前天数可根据IMSS程序转移至产后使用。",
  "Up to 90% course and salary support for eligible cases; higher support for mature or long-term unemployed groups where criteria are met.": "符合条件的案例可获最高90%的课程及薪资支持；符合标准的成熟型或长期失业群体可获更高支持。",
  "Up to 90% refund of training costs for courses explicitly focused on Artificial Intelligence, subject to HRDC conditions.": "明确以人工智能为重点的课程培训费用，可获最高90%退款，须符合人力资源发展公司（HRDC）条件。",
  "Up to 98 daily allowances within the official framework for care leave.": "在护理假官方框架内最多98个日津贴。",
  "Up to AUD 10,000.": "最高澳元10,000元。",
  "Up to CAD 5,000 for every opportunity offered to a student through the programme, according to Canada.ca.": "根据Canada.ca，通过该项目向学生提供的每个机会最高可获加元5,000元。",
  "Up to eligible GPML weeks depending on statutory conditions and child order/scheme rules.": "根据法定条件及子女出生顺序/计划规则，享有符合条件的政府带薪育儿假（GPML）周数。",
  "Up to maximum 50% of the annual training contribution paid, subject to ITF reimbursement criteria and training categories.": "最高可获已缴年度培训捐款的50%报销，须符合ITF报销标准及培训类别要求。",
  "Up to one year, extendable under BPS rules.": "最长一年，可依据BPS规定延期。",
  "Up to six months after job loss, according to Superfinanciera explanation.": "根据Superfinanciera说明，失业后最长六个月。",
  "Up to statutory occupational accident benefit period depending on recovery and assessment.": "根据康复情况及评估结果，享受法定工伤事故津贴期限。",
  "Up to the 168th day from the child's birth, with special rules for premature children.": "自子女出生之日起最长至第168天，早产儿适用特殊规定。",
  "Up to the statutory SANED compensation period; application should be made within 90 days from leaving work.": "最长至法定SANED补偿期限；申请应在离职后90天内提交。",
  "Up to two consecutive taxable years when eligible.": "符合条件时最多连续两个纳税年度。",
  "Up to two uses per person according to HRDF eligibility; certificate approval/validity limits apply.": "根据HRDF资格规定，每人最多使用两次；证书批准/有效期限制适用。",
  "Update employment termination and contribution records accurately.": "准确更新劳动关系终止及缴费记录。",
  "Upon retirement/end of service where contribution and legal conditions are met.": "在满足缴费及法定条件的情况下，于退休/服务终止时适用。",
