  "Useful for HR planning but it is a training/allowance scheme, not a wage reimbursement for an ordinary employee.": "对人力资源规划有用，但这是培训/津贴计划，而非普通雇员的工资报销。",
  "Useful for HR/payroll only when aid covers hiring, training or employment cost.": "仅当援助涵盖招聘、培训或用工成本时，对人力资源/工资核算有用。",
