  "Useful for workforce transition or self-employment support, not normal employee payroll.": "对劳动力转型或自雇支持有用，而非正常雇员工资。",
  "Usually 126 calendar days after 30+ weeks pregnancy; extra 14 days for complicated childbirth or multiple births; special rules apply.": "通常为妊娠满30周后126个历日；难产或多胎分娩额外14天；特殊规则适用。",
  "Usually 15 weeks for single birth; longer for multiple birth or specific situations.": "单胎通常为15周；多胎或特定情况下更长。",
  "Usually annual calculation/payment cycle via payroll taxes, subject to LKV type.": "通常通过工资税按年度计算/支付，具体取决于LKV类型。",
  "Usually limited benefit period after loss of employment under EIS rules.": "根据EIS规定，失业后通常享有有限的津贴期。",
  "Usually no employee action unless aid is employee/training related.": "通常无需雇员采取行动，除非援助与雇员/培训相关。",
  "Usually not an employer claim, but HR must issue accurate termination/payroll documents.": "通常不属于雇主申请，但人力资源部门必须出具准确的劳动关系终止/工资文件。",
