  "Usually not payroll cost, but HR may need to support employment verification.": "通常不属于工资成本，但人力资源部门可能需要支持就业核实。",
  "VSAA pays paternity benefit for 10 working days of paternity leave; amount is based on insured income under VSAA rules.": "VSAA为10个工作日的陪产假支付陪产津贴；金额依据VSAA规则以参保收入为基础计算。",
  "VSAA pays sickness benefit from the 10th day of illness; for general sickness, employer-paid early days are separate.": "VSAA自患病第10天起支付疾病津贴；对于一般疾病，雇主支付的前期天数另行计算。",
