  "Vacancy details, recruitment needs, employer information.": "职位空缺详情、招聘需求、雇主信息。",
  "Varies by case: e.g. 12 weeks for specified cases, 6 weeks after miscarriage/MTP; other statutory periods apply under ESIC rules.": "视情况而定：例如特定情况下为12周，流产/人工终止妊娠后为6周；ESIC规则下适用其他法定期限。",
